<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show rise in net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show rise in net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Thursday showed that net currency reserves rose to about 103.4 billion marks in the week ending February 23 from about 103.2 billion marks in the week ending February 15.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in</p>
<p>billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    Feb 23	  Feb 15</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     119.0	   118.9</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   15.6	    15.7</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
